## Troubleshooting

### Docker images won't load

Ensure Docker is running and you have sufficient disk space:

```bash
docker info
df -h
```

### Cannot push to internal registry

1. Verify registry is accessible: `curl -k https://{{ k8s_tutum_offline_internal_registry | default('your-registry') }}/v2/`
2. Login to registry: `docker login {{ k8s_tutum_offline_internal_registry | default('your-registry') }}`
3. Check network connectivity

### Ansible collection not found

Verify the collection was installed:

```bash
ansible-galaxy collection list | grep {{ k8s_tutum_offline_collection_name }}
```

